{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"1a9fbe78fa5ff98f","type":"text","text":"**The Everything**, *Infinity*","x":-265,"y":-280,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"3e114106e8663f68","type":"text","text":"**Krone**, *Entity of Time*","x":-540,"y":170,"width":290,"height":60},
		{"id":"e3dbe17fa280fca1","type":"text","text":"''*To bring about Change*''","x":-520,"y":260,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"aaa384353d7975e7","type":"text","text":"**Lithavis**, *Entity of Matter*","x":380,"y":170,"width":300,"height":60},
		{"id":"5604079c3c615875","type":"text","text":"''*To bring about Physical Realities, Concreteness*''","x":405,"y":260,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"7149805dd0257be1","type":"text","text":"**Xoria**, *The Mother, Creator of All*","x":-80,"y":-180,"width":285,"height":60},
		{"id":"981b8d40d93c26c8","type":"text","text":"**Nephelos**, *Entity of Loss*","x":-63,"y":-80,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"fc2a799dceea801f","type":"text","text":"**The Nothing**, *The Void*","x":143,"y":-280,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"848e1f08471ee5b6","type":"text","text":"*''With Creation comes Constraint. When things can exist and not exist, can be made and destroyed, can be awaited and forgotten, Meaning emerges. And from Meaning, there is Life.*''","x":-107,"y":30,"width":365,"height":140,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"ce2580ef677b0ae9","type":"text","text":"**The Flow**: To allow for the transference and rest of Souls, a pocket in Time and Space was gifted to All Creatures by Krone.","x":-880,"y":384,"width":250,"height":152,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"8af0974b5f4611d4","type":"text","text":"**Form & Essence**: Sculpted from the Earth of Lithavis, the bodies the world's creatures were raised upon the new earth.","x":800,"y":384,"width":250,"height":152,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"02c98adab55b191e","type":"text","text":"**Morai**, *Primordial Goddess of Fate*","x":-433,"y":610,"width":313,"height":50},
		{"id":"1b1f841b6c42ddc5","type":"text","text":"**Lathander**, Primordial God of New Beginnings & Renewal","x":230,"y":610,"width":425,"height":50},
		{"id":"f1a516d030d919f3","type":"text","text":"''*With New Beginnings comes Birth and Creativity*''","x":318,"y":695,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"d70c81ee1d4d62bd","type":"text","text":"**The World**; At Xoria's request, Lithavis and Krone created the world wherein Xoria could bring upon Meaning through Life. The Land of Xoria is named as such as it represents the continent where the High Gods once inhabited.","x":-49,"y":222,"width":250,"height":238,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"7578053aec3f4a74","type":"text","text":"**The Elementals**: The elements of Fire, Earth, Air, and Water were required to finalize the ecosystem of the Earth. The raging forces of Lathander and Lithavis were controlled by their three children.","x":680,"y":738,"width":250,"height":204,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"69f77a2f2325cf5b","type":"text","text":"''*To bring Balance; for things to be maintained, there are Shoulds and Shouldn'ts*''","x":130,"y":895,"width":250,"height":100,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"12c7f8024a1d310d","type":"text","text":"''*Offering both Guidance and Opportunity, Fate is both Determined and Controlled*''","x":-409,"y":695,"width":250,"height":85,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"c7194ec476b8461c","type":"text","text":"''*To mark an End of one's Timeline, Myrkul was created*''","x":-200,"y":897,"width":250,"height":95,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"396905fa090f6e3f","type":"text","text":"**Istishia**, *High God of Water*","x":530,"y":1020,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"30dc312a7ce79b82","type":"text","text":"**Kossuth**, *High God of Fire*","x":443,"y":1110,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"bd01fa632ae3b7b3","type":"text","text":"**Grumbar**, *High God of Earth*","x":930,"y":1110,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"61f82907dc97c5d0","type":"text","text":"**Akadi**, *High Goddess of Air*","x":840,"y":1020,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"22ff15f1d8bb4026","type":"text","text":"**The Weave**: From the overwhelming and chaotic energy of Time and Fate, the Weave was created, allowing one to bend the laws of the Universe to their will. The Weave brought Gods of great power.","x":-755,"y":758,"width":250,"height":237,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"497c14f93e640ac5","type":"text","text":"**Mystra**, *High Goddess of Magic*","x":-920,"y":1050,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"d9bf321d902581f6","type":"text","text":"*Much of the Origins of the Gods and their families have yet to be uncovered; nonetheless, Seers and the Pious of Old have suggested dividing the other Gods according to their estimated Alignment and Belonging within the families of the Weave (Ex: Ether), of the Elementals (Ex: Sashelas & Umberlee), of the Just (Ex: Tymora), or of the Unknown (i.e It isn't clear where they belong)*.","x":-159,"y":1800,"width":590,"height":140,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"871eda1cf551a5ab","type":"text","text":"**Azur**, *High Goddess of the Ether*","x":-630,"y":1050,"width":303,"height":60},
		{"id":"9f23452c2a715bcc","type":"text","text":"**Vecna**, *High God of Mystery & Secrets*","x":-520,"y":1140,"width":327,"height":62},
		{"id":"1147a06cbafd6424","type":"text","text":"**Savras**, *High God of Divination*","x":-1005,"y":1142,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"e2bc4adc0435852d","type":"text","text":"**Selena**, *Goddess of Night*","x":-481,"y":1600,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"547afe517a14bb3f","type":"text","text":"**Cyrela**, *Goddess of Day*","x":5,"y":1600,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"3e16867b893d8da1","type":"text","text":"**Myrkul**, *Primordial God of Death & Decay*","x":-300,"y":820,"width":363,"height":60},
		{"id":"5710992a82b36eda","type":"text","text":"To guide the functioning of the New World, Xoria and Nephelos bore the Primordials","x":-49,"y":494,"width":250,"height":85,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"9b23ae645d8ae524","type":"text","text":"**Tyr**, *Primordial  God of Justice*","x":133,"y":820,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"5f4a4cf8384bc2f1","type":"text","text":"**Ether**, *God of Darkness*","x":-356,"y":1720,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"8bcabd44b397a332","type":"text","text":"**Tymora**, *Goddess of Luck & Adventurers*","x":306,"y":1720,"width":250,"height":60}
	],
