		{"id":"a96858a9b27fa9ab","fromNode":"871eda1cf551a5ab","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"e2bc4adc0435852d","toSide":"top","color":"6","label":"Azur, the embodiment of the dichotomy of night and day, chose to rend herself apart, becoming two new people, as she was unable to fight the chaos within her, nor be with the one she loved, Myrkul. Although born again as someone different, she found Myrkul once more as she descended to the Underworld as Selena."},
